Question 11.  
Consider the class shown on the right and make no assumptions 
regarding import statements. Which of the following must 
replace <code> to allow the class to compile and execute 
correctly and allow the user to enter two values from the 
keyboard? 
A) System.out 

B) in 
C) Scanner.in 

D) Scanner.nextInt() 
E) System.in  
import java.util.Scanner; 
public class Q11 { 
public static void main(String[] args) { 
 Scanner keyboard=new Scanner(<code>); 
 System.out.print("Enter first number: "); 
 int num1=keyboard.nextInt(); 
 System.out.print("Enter second number: "); 
 int num2=keyboard.nextInt(); 
 System.out.print("Sum = "+(num1+num2)); 
 } 
} 
